      <activity id="e2958b53-16a8-525a-8eb6-5d5b7badf518" activityNameId="8cdf8aa7-cda5-5ad9-9fea-8066cb8d9a1c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Printed wiring board, through-hole mounted, unspec., Pb containing, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Printed wiring board, through-hole mounted, unspec., Pb containing, at plant
The data represent an unspecified, through-hole mounted, PWB , used in electronic and electric devices. Material data are based on literature and own dismantling activities. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions.;
UUID: ac052633-3740-35a8-9c72-9c5afa7279c2
This dataset covers component input and production efforts (incl. PWB waste due to failure in mounting) for the production of an unspecified, through-hole mounted, PWB, using Pb-containing solder material.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average PWB mounting technology (wave soldering)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature &amp; own estimations 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ac052633-3740-35a8-9c72-9c5afa7279c2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
